OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA fresh start with fine and dry
OL,6,Fconditions. Cloud bubbling up with the
OL,7,Frisk of a light shower through the
OL,8,Fafternoon. Temperatures near average
OL,9,Fbut feeling cool in gusty winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FLargely fine and dry
OL,12,Fovernight with an easing wind, but
OL,13,Fperhaps the odd light shower at first.
OL,14,FClear spells though the night and
OL,15,Fwinds becoming light and variable by
OL,16,Fdawn.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
