OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CSunday:FA fine and dry day on Sunday,
OL,6,Fwith light winds and patchy fair
OL,7,Fweather cloud developing through the
OL,8,Fday. Becoming cloudier overnight with
OL,9,Frain arriving later.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FRain
OL,12,Fand low cloud into Monday, heavy at
OL,13,Ftimes. Drier Monday afternoon with
OL,14,Ffurther rain Tuesday morning and a
OL,15,Fdeveloping moderate to fresh breeze.
OL,16,FDrier thereafter but remaining windy.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
